sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KServeRouter as KServe Router /<br/>Istio Gateway
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar (8443/TCP)
    participant HTTP as vllm-spyre HTTP<br/>8000/TCP
    participant GRPC as vllm-spyre gRPC<br/>8033/TCP
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine
    participant Spyre as IBM Spyre<br/>Accelerator
    participant PVC as Model Storage<br/>(PVC / S3)

    Note over Client,PVC: Flow 1: HTTP Inference Request (OpenAI-compatible)
    Client->>KServeRouter: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
    KServeRouter->>KRBP: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS 1.2+
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate Bearer Token<br/>against Kubernetes RBAC
    KRBP->>HTTP: Forward (pre-authenticated)<br/>HTTP/8000 (localhost)
    HTTP->>Engine: Process inference request
    Engine->>Spyre: Offload computation<br/>to Spyre accelerator
    Spyre-->>Engine: Inference result
    Engine-->>HTTP: Completion response
    HTTP-->>KRBP: JSON response
    KRBP-->>KServeRouter: HTTPS response
    KServeRouter-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>(OpenAI format)

    Note over Client,PVC: Flow 2: gRPC Inference Request (TGIS-compatible)
    Client->>KServeRouter: gRPC GenerationService.Generate<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
    KServeRouter->>KRBP: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS 1.2+
    KRBP->>KRBP: Validate Bearer Token<br/>against Kubernetes RBAC
    KRBP->>GRPC: Forward (pre-authenticated)<br/>gRPC/8033 (localhost)
    GRPC->>Engine: Process generation request
    Engine->>Spyre: Offload computation<br/>to Spyre accelerator
    Spyre-->>Engine: Inference result
    Engine-->>GRPC: Generation response
    GRPC-->>KRBP: gRPC response
    KRBP-->>KServeRouter: HTTPS response
    KServeRouter-->>Client: gRPC Response<br/>(TGIS format)

    Note over Client,PVC: Model Loading (Startup)
    PVC->>Engine: Load model weights<br/>via volume mount (filesystem)
    Engine->>Spyre: Initialize model<br/>on Spyre accelerator
    Note right of Engine: HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1<br/>No network model downloads
